---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Peggy Pei-Chun Hsieh — Learning Experience Designer"
  description="Peggy Pei-Chun Hsieh designs meaningful learning experiences and runs international education programmes in Taiwan — across education, consulting, and marketing."
>
  <!-- ==== 1. HERO ====================================================== -->
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Learning experience designer · Taiwan</p>
    <h1>Peggy Pei-Chun Hsieh</h1>
    <div class="hero__lines">
      <p>I design learning experiences that people actually finish — and remember.</p>
      <p>For learners, universities, and teams growing across languages and borders.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="uwp-button uwp-button--lg" href="/en/contact/">Start a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 2. WHY ME =================================================== -->
  <section class="wrap section wrap--prose">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">Why me</p>
      <h2>Twenty years turning education into experiences that land.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I've spent my career on both sides of learning — recruiting and advising students bound overseas, running an international university forum, and now facilitating professional cohorts at TalentLabs. The through-line is the same: make the experience clear, human, and worth finishing.</p>
      <p>I pair instructional and behavioural design with the practical work of getting people to show up: marketing, facilitation, and cross-cultural communication in English and Mandarin. I'm at my best where learning design meets real people who first have to be persuaded to start.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 3. AT A GLANCE ============================================ -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">At a glance</p>
      <h2>How to place me quickly</h2>
    </div>
    <dl class="strip">
      <div class="strip__item">
        <dt>Based</dt>
        <dd>Taiwan</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="strip__item">
        <dt>Focus</dt>
        <dd>Learning experience &amp; instructional design</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="strip__item">
        <dt>Languages</dt>
        <dd>English &amp; Mandarin</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="strip__item strip__marks">
        <span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">E-learning consulting</span>
        <span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">Experience design</span>
        <span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--outline">Behavioural design</span>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 4. WHAT I CARE ABOUT ================================= -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">What I care about</p>
      <h2>The ideas I keep coming back to</h2>
      <p>Not a manifesto — just the questions that shape how I design learning.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="problems">
      <li>
        <h3>Learning people finish</h3>
        <p>Completion is a design problem, not a willpower problem. I care about the small frictions that quietly decide whether someone takes the next step or drifts away.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Peer and social learning</h3>
        <p>People learn faster and stay longer alongside others. I'm drawn to formats where learners teach, and pull each other forward, rather than sit through content alone.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Learning across cultures</h3>
        <p>Having studied and worked across Taiwan and Australia, I design for learners moving between languages and expectations — where a good experience has to translate, not just be translated.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 5. SOFT CTA =============================================== -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <h2>If you're working on how people learn, let's talk.</h2>
      <p>I'm always glad to hear from teams building education or learning products, universities running international programmes, and anyone thinking hard about learning experience. I read every note.</p>
      <a class="uwp-button uwp-button--accent uwp-button--lg" href="/en/contact/">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
